Subject: [Buildroot] [PATCH 3/6] coreutils: fixed missing hostname
In-Reply-To: <1285296904-25793-1-git-send-email-Martin.Banky@gmail.com>
References: <1285296904-25793-1-git-send-email-Martin.Banky@gmail.com>
